overseer-core adapts material from the following MIT-licensed projects.
The adapted sites carry an "Adapted from …" header line naming the file.

## hermes-agent (github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent)

Ported/adapted: the threat-pattern table, scopes and invisible-Unicode
set (`src/memory/threat.rs`, from `tools/threat_patterns.py`); the
memory-review signal lexicon, prompt guidance and validation rules
(`src/memory/learn.rs`, from `agent/background_review.py`); the
trivial-prompt recall skip list (`src/memory/learn.rs`).

