## Agent Memory Repo (github.com/BMonsalvatge/amr)

`src/memory/amr.rs` renders each store's `MEMORY.md` per the AMR spec
(`SPEC.md`: `# Memory:` header, `## Index`, `[[note]]` link syntax).

